        "original_id": "b7680616-e820-53e8-b1fb-eb0cf0674ab1",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: San Andrés Accords\n- Organizations: Zapatista Army of National Liberation, Mexican government, Institutional Revolutionary Party (PRI)\n- People: Ernesto Zedillo\n- Roles: President of Mexico\n\nFacts:\n- Ernesto Zedillo served as President of Mexico from December 1, 1994 to November 30, 2000.\n- Ernesto Zedillo was the last president in the uninterrupted 70-year line of Mexican presidents from the Institutional Revolutionary Party (PRI).\n- The San Andrés Accords are agreements reached between the Zapatista Army of National Liberation and the Mexican government.\n- The Mexican government was headed at that time by President Ernesto Zedillo.",
